{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2020-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1580515200, "end_date": 1581119999, "month_true_total": 2351, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:00:01 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "63127629", "author": {"steamid": "76561198139453395", "personaname": "Ahmaruko", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ahmaruko/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 255524, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 290, "playtime_at_review": 146827, "last_played": 1789409914, "avatar": "1454c7d29372359bf8b4b3f42b4158b837f41c9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is probably one of the BEST ever, it is ALWAYS bringing out more and more content. I don't know anyone that has fully finished the game or perfected it. It's an absolute journey that needs to be taken. Highly Recommended, Free to Play as well.", "timestamp_created": 1581117334, "timestamp_updated": 1581117334, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "63126826", "author": {"steamid": "76561198187915478", "personaname": "b1nkster", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198187915478/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 27894, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 27573, "last_played": 1721284800, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Having kept an eye on this game's progress over the last several years, I have to say it's finally come into it's own, and is generally fantastic for games in this genre.  Two thumbs up for the guys at Digital Extremes!", "timestamp_created": 1581115741, "timestamp_updated": 1581115741, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "63126369", "author": {"steamid": "76561198800148971", "personaname": "Lemur", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lemursquared/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 93426, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 10, "playtime_at_review": 41444, "last_played": 1788393439, "avatar": "e9166249eb803ac5f6ea3667b92b1f038f3b8e49"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warframe in general is probably the most backwards F2P game I've ever seen. You don't have to spend a single penny to fully enjoy everything this game has to offer. Obviously there is some instances where you do have to grind until time stops but the appealing visuals and satisfying controls kinda reduce the amount of times you say \"Oh my god someone put me out of my misery.\" \n\nI've been playing this game for a long time in comparison to other games where I'll pick them up for a bit and then just drop them because it gets stale. Not to say Warframe doesn't get stale, because that'd be a flat out lie. But burnout tends to take longer to occur when playing Warframe. \n\nBasically, try Warframe for a bit. And I mean really [b] try [/b] the game. The opening is very noob friendly but once you get past that stage the real \"fun\" begins. If you can keep your resolve, there you go. If not, that's totally fine.", "timestamp_created": 1581114920, "timestamp_updated": 1581114920, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": fal